    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d477">

                <pb facs="0647" n="555" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg555"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Food Administrator’s File</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Food Administrator</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hoover</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Food Administration Representative at London</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sheldon</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-06-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 4, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Answering No. 176, British pork program unsatisfactory but think wise to leave
                    further argument as to program until I come over Our cable 95, lard not included
                    in figures given.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hoover</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
